        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "A company specializing in the manufacture of large telescope mirrors.\n\nMr. Fullum is highly skilled and delivers his mirrors and optical assemblies with exceptional quality, from manufacturing to delivery.\n\nHe manufactures parabolic mirrors 30 inches in diameter and larger, with precision exceeding standard industry norms.\nExceptionally, he agreed to evaluate and re-aluminize, with a protective coating, my small 6-inch f/6 mirror!\n\nHe gave me a tour of his factory, and I am still amazed by the advanced technology of the machines he designed.\n\nI highly recommend his products and services, which are unique in Canada.\nTHANK YOU, Mr. Fullum!\n\n5 STARS… and more 🔭",
        "time": 1694715146,
        "translated": true
      },
